  "whatWeKeep": "What we keep",
  "privacy1": "Accounts, transactions, cards, budgets, goals, loans, lists and purchases: everything stays on this device, in an encrypted local database.",
  "privacy2": "We don't ask for e-mail, tax id or bank password. There is no bank connection. No financial data is sent to servers.",
  "privacy3": "Subscriptions are processed by Apple or Google; we only receive confirmation of access, never payment data.",
