  "eraseAll": "Erase everything on this device",
  "eraseHelp": "Erasing removes data, preferences, database key and subscription cache. Store purchases can be restored later.",
  "privacyPolicyNote": "Full privacy policy and terms will be published at serenacash.app/privacidade before the store launch.",
  "eraseQ": "Erase everything?",
